IEEE MAC address registries
---------------------------

Copyright (c) The Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers, Inc.

  oui.csv     MA-L, 24-bit assignments — the classic OUI listing
      https://standards-oui.ieee.org/oui/oui.csv

  mam.csv     MA-M, 28-bit assignments
      https://standards-oui.ieee.org/oui28/mam.csv

  oui36.csv   MA-S, 36-bit assignments
      https://standards-oui.ieee.org/oui36/oui36.csv

  iab.csv     IAB, 36-bit assignments; a closed registry, retained because
              devices holding an IAB assignment are still in the field
      https://standards-oui.ieee.org/iab/iab.csv

