These files are inputs to firmware/build.rs, which repacks them into the QSPI
asset image and the internal lookup tables. The packing format is Sonde's; the
underlying data is not.

Refresh them from upstream with scripts/refresh_data.py, which holds the same
URLs in its SOURCES map.
